      "content": "5.1 Agriculture"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Agriculture forms a core foundational pillar of Uttarakhand's rural economy.",
        "Horticulture plays a vital role in fruit and spice production across the hilly regions.",
        "Hydropower potential represents a major source of state revenue and energy generation.",
        "Tourism serves as a critical service sector and key employment generator in the state.",
        "Industrial growth is driven by strategic state policies and industrial infrastructure."
      ],
      "id": "a276ijd"
    },
