    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "p11ydaf",
      "content": "Agriculture and allied sectors engage about 70% of rural population. Uttarakhand has two distinct agricultural zones: the hills (largely rain-fed, terraced farming) and the terai-bhabar (irrigated plains, mechanised farming)."
