    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "cmuenoz",
      "content": "Uttarakhand is promoting itself as a major horticultural state. The state produces apples, apricots, pears, peaches, walnuts, and exotic vegetables. The 'Hill Cultivation Mission' and 'Zero Budget Natural Farming' are flagship programmes."
