      "content": "5.3 Hydropower"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "opo43em",
      "content": "Uttarakhand has an estimated hydropower potential of 20,000 MW — one of the highest in India. The Alaknanda and Bhagirathi river basins are the main power corridors. However, the 2013 Kedarnath disaster and subsequent NGT orders have slowed some projects."
