      "content": "5.4 Tourism"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "i1m76iw",
      "content": "Tourism is the backbone of Uttarakhand's economy. The state hosts millions of pilgrims annually for Char Dham Yatra. Adventure tourism (trekking, river rafting, skiing) is growing rapidly."
