      "content": "5.5 Industry"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "3t1ly1m",
      "content": "The Terai region (Haridwar-Rudrapur SIDCUL corridor) is Uttarakhand's industrial hub. Central government incentives (2003–2013) boosted manufacturing. Post-incentive, industries have consolidated."
